# Used with `docker build -f bcc_middleware/Dockerfile .` from the repository root (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile). Deny by default so the root-sized context stays
# small and nothing secret-adjacent (.env, keys, deployments files) can be copied by accident.
*
!integrity-sdk/pyproject.toml
!integrity-sdk/README.md
!integrity-sdk/integrity_sdk
!bcc_middleware/pyproject.toml
!bcc_middleware/uv.lock
!bcc_middleware/app
!bcc_middleware/policies
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
